   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一名女士正在把塑料盆里的雨水装进洒水壶。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "30339226"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6a/6c/6a6c9c3e55985e4d4658a8f564c404e2.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6a/6c/6a6c9c3e55985e4d4658a8f564c404e2.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在屋顶花园摆放一张躺椅，用木质储物盒充当小桌子，营造出轻松休闲的氛围。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "30287411"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/12/70/12705b979c9dc9554415e0b087676d47.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/12/70/12705b979c9dc9554415e0b087676d47.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>现在，你已经布置好了屋顶空间，花园里的植物可以不断成长了。接下来该做什么呢？尽享轻松！在花园里摆放几张椅子，再摆上一张小桌子或盒子来放饮品，享用收获的果蔬。</p>"
   ],
